        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't even think about it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Instructor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you spacing out for? You almost got yourself killed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm... I'm sorry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Quick! Get back into formation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yessir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dobermann! You made it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's an emergency. My team was attacked by Reunion as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "I rushed over to join you as soon as I could.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would Reunion attack us...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "An organization made up of the Infected... I've always thought they were a bit extreme...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "...and now they've resorted to violence, and in an Ursus city no less? That's a death wish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "The situation is only going to get more chaotic from here on out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, we need to leave Chernobog right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay. We've already rescued the Doctor, so we can retreat according to plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "...And this is Dr. {@nickname}?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, you probably don't know who I am, but you know Amiya. For your safety...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, Dobermann, Doctor isn't doing very well right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "To put it simply, Doctor... has amnesia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amnesia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What are you going to do now? Weren't you planning to transfer leadership to\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor still has the capacity to command.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...At least, I've confirmed that from the previous battle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't bring myself to trust a stranger so easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I trust you, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, I am Dobermann, captain of Op Team E1.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are going to escort you from Chernobog, which is the Ursus city we're currently in, back to Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_map_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "image": "avg_map_1",
        "tiled": true,
        "xScaleTo": 1.3,
        "yScaleTo": 1.3,
        "xTo": -200,
        "duration": 75,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "We're in an abandoned facility in Chernobog and should now head west.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "image": "avg_map_1",
        "tiled": true,
        "xScaleTo": 1.8,
        "yScaleTo": 1.8,
        "xTo": -200,
        "duration": 75,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "But... since we're cut off from Dr. Kal'tsit, Dobermann and I have lead our separate teams westward to a rendezvous point before confirming our signal to retreat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is, assuming everything goes according to plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'd be nice if things went that smoothly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Today is our last opportunity to get you out of here, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... I have a bad feeling about this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A-Amiya!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's... it's a call from Rhodes Island!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are our communications back on? Is it Dr. Kal'tsit...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, but not quite.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "bg_2_call"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "PRTS...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Emergency Neural Connection Request System was activated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PRTS"
    },
    {
        "text": "Interference has also been detected from Rhodes Island's end, and only partial Neural Network connection is possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PRTS"
    },
    {
        "text": "Currently unable to establish communication with Kal'tsit, who has yet to return to Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PRTS"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your safety is confirmed; therefore, my mission is now complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PRTS"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "This piece of...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do we really have time for this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you do not need to connect to Rhodes Island, communication will be severed momentarily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PRTS"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am sincerely sorry for having interrupted your party.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PRTS"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, wait! Don't hang up, I need your help still.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dobermann, Doctor still needs some assistance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, but make it quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, PRTS is also one of our... partners. It will show you what to do next.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Time is of the essence, so I'm going to reconnect you to the Rhodes Island backup system.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This way, we'll have an edge in battle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's different from giving verbal commands and might be a bit hard to get used to, but once you learn how to use it, the entire operation will be much smoother.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Please trust me. Just like how you used to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "PRTS... Let's start.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Identity verification required. Select verification method.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "PRTS"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Doctor... Please say something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "(Speak)",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
